{"product":{"id":9728653328609,"title":"MANGO 90","body_html":"<p>The Mango 90 is our narrowest park platform: a 90mm true-center twin cultivated with Jake Mageau, the most evolved style in skiing.</p>\n<p>True to our Oregon-grown freestyle roots, the Mango Series spans three widths (90, 102, and 114) and is built around a soft, snappy core flex and aggressively rounded tip taper for more pop and smoother edge transitions. On the Mango 90, a true-center mount and Elliptical Sidecut keep the ski balanced through presses, swaps, and off-axis rotations. Signature Rocker keeps the feel playful and buttery. This is the Mango for rails, jumps, rope tows, and skiers who live in the park. Grow your flow.</p>\n<p>Every Mango 90 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon, our proprietary composite weave that improves strength and durability while decreasing weight. Pair that with our trademark 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing, and you have the most durable park ski we know how to build.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:12-07:00","handle":"mango-90","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:18-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Mango, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128487452897,"product_id":9728653328609,"title":"161cm / Stock","price":"799.00","sku":"27ON3PM90161","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"161cm","option2":"Stock","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:12-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":50130712396001,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":8,"old_inventory_quantity":8,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_pr